From 44140d4ed19f4d6a377456d8ec9143c49bd26041 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meeyao <139587960+meeyao@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:44:48 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] st/oxr: implement XR_HTCX_vive_tracker_interaction with FBT
 tracker roles

Enable the HTCX vive-tracker interaction extension and add the 8 body-tracker
role subaction paths (/user/vive_tracker_htcx/role/{waist,chest,left/right
_foot,_knee,_elbow}) so OpenXR clients (VRChat FBT) can bind trackers by role.
Adds the subaction enum/macros/path-cache/role lookup plumbing, the
vive_tracker_htcx interaction profile (grip pose -> XRT_INPUT_GENERIC_TRACKER_POSE),
and xrt_system_roles tracker index+profile fields.
---
